The data source is identified using <arg>dataId</arg>. If specified as a string, it references the data source that is connected to a dictionary that is part of an application. If specified as a number, it is processed as a <link action_invoker_resource_ids.csdoc>resource ID</link> returned by <action>Data.open</action>. This typically references non-application data sources. While optional, this should generally be specified explicitly. (If there is only one data source open, the resource ID can be calculated implicitly.)
